# Engineering Quality

## Stack

Next.js 16 · React 19 · TypeScript strict · Drizzle + SQLite/libSQL · TanStack Query

Read `AGENTS.md` and `node_modules/next/dist/docs/` before changing Next APIs.

## Validation

```bash
npm run lint
npm run typecheck
npm test
npm run build
```

Small reviewable commits. No mass formatting mixed with logic.

## Security

- Never commit `.env`, tokens, `*.db`, real application notes.
- Parameterized SQL / Drizzle only; allowlisted PATCH fields.
- Never client-set `score` / `fitLabel` / audit fields.
- `PRISM_DEMO_MODE` blocks mutations, sync, rescore, expensive jobs.
- Backup DB before destructive migrations.

## TypeScript

Prefer `unknown` at boundaries, schemas/unions, Drizzle inference. Avoid fake casts and critical `any`.
